WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.953
A hybrid AI architecture uses more than one execution environment and places

00:00:04.953 --> 00:00:06.975
work according to explicit requirements.

00:00:06.975 --> 00:00:11.424
Local workstations or private servers may handle sensitive or latency-critical tasks.

00:00:11.424 --> 00:00:14.255
Cloud GPUs can provide temporary accelerator capacity.

00:00:14.255 --> 00:00:19.108
Hosted model APIs can offer capabilities that are difficult to operate locally,

00:00:19.108 --> 00:00:23.152
while private cloud deployments extend organizational control into provider infrastructure.

00:00:23.152 --> 00:00:27.197
Hybrid does not mean sending every request to every environment.

00:00:27.197 --> 00:00:32.050
It means defining which components process which inputs, where data is stored,

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:36.498
and how the system behaves when a preferred resource is unavailable.

00:00:36.498 --> 00:00:41.351
A local model and a cloud endpoint connected by an undocumented fallback

00:00:41.351 --> 00:00:43.374
are not a sound architecture.

00:00:43.374 --> 00:00:46.205
The routing policy, privacy boundary, authentication, logging,

00:00:46.205 --> 00:00:49.440
and failure behavior must be visible and testable.

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:51.462
The design balances competing objectives.

00:00:51.462 --> 00:00:55.506
Local execution can improve privacy, control, and predictable marginal cost,

00:00:55.506 --> 00:00:59.551
but it is limited by owned hardware and maintenance capacity.

00:00:59.551 --> 00:01:03.190
Cloud services offer elasticity, specialized models, and remote access,

00:01:03.190 --> 00:01:06.426
but introduce network latency, metered spending, provider dependency,

00:01:06.426 --> 00:01:08.043
and another data boundary.

00:01:08.043 --> 00:01:10.066
Reliability may improve through alternatives,

00:01:10.066 --> 00:01:13.301
or decrease if additional dependencies are poorly managed.

00:01:13.301 --> 00:01:18.963
Workload placement is an engineering decision, not an ideological commitment to local or cloud.

00:01:18.963 --> 00:01:23.007
Begin with data classification, user experience, model capability, volume, availability,

00:01:23.007 --> 00:01:23.816
and cost.

00:01:23.816 --> 00:01:29.478
Choose the simplest placement that satisfies them, document why, and measure the complete flow.

00:01:29.478 --> 00:01:35.140
A useful hybrid system gains flexibility without making data movement or operational responsibility ambiguous.
